   "stars": 5,
   "date": "1 week ago",
   "text": "Beautiful place, beautiful interior - loads of amenities that you just don\u2019t typically find in Bournemouth. The host Leo is very responsive, helpful and friendly and went above and beyond to make our stay as easy and enjoyable as possible - even with a late booking on my end. Could not recommend enough & will definitely be looking to book this property before others, every time I return to Bournemouth!"
  },
  {
   "name": "Uzma",
   "stars": 5,
   "date": "1 week ago",
   "text": "Absolutely loved my break in this beautiful apartment, was very clean!. The hot tub and sauna was 10/10, Leo was so helpful with any questions I had and responded almost instantly. I will always be trying to come back here everytime I visit Bournemouth!"
  },
  {
   "name": "Yasmin",
   "stars": 5,
