  {
   "name": "Hannah",
   "stars": 5,
   "date": "2 days ago",
   "text": "Leo\u2019s place is exactly like the pictures. It\u2019s immaculate, the hot tub and sauna are lovely and the apartment feels like a home away from home. It\u2019s spacious, easy to locate and a genuinely lovely place. We haven\u2019t been to the area before, but it wasn\u2019t for us. This isn\u2019t a direct reflection on Leo\u2019s place, it is a personal preference that Bournemouth just wasn\u2019t for us. That aside, we would have returned to the apartment if located elsewhere."
  },
  {
   "name": "Kate",
   "stars": 5,
   "date": "2 weeks ago",
   "text": "We had a lovely few days away at Leo's house, took the kids away before they went back to school. We were hoping to spend most of the time on the beach but unfortunately it rained so we made use of the hot tub and sauna. Leo's house was spotless inside and out. The beds were comfortable, bedroom and lounge had a fan which was a bouns. Lots of space for our belongings. Bathroom was perfect and very well thought out. Kitchen had everything we needed, my only tiny moan was that we couldn't use the coffee machine as the pods provided were just the milk pods and not the coffee pods."
  }
